        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, Section 107 of the Jumpstart Our Business Startups Act of 2012 (the “JOBS Act”) also provides that an “emerging growth company” can take advantage of the extended transition period provided in Section 7(a)(2)(B) of the Securities Act for complying with new or revised accounting standards.",
        "start_character": 51008,
        "end_character": 51310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The provider-supported GCC services market is experiencing increased competition as various categories of service providers enter the sector with specialized offerings.1 However, we believe the substantial market growth and evolving complexity of enterprise requirements create opportunities for providers who can deliver integrated, results-driven solutions across the complete GCC lifecycle.",
        "start_character": 11622,
        "end_character": 12015
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe this technology-enabled GCC approach enhances operational effectiveness, enabling us to provide digital transformation services that support our clients’ growth objectives and strengthen their competitive positioning in a rapidly evolving digital marketplace.",
        "start_character": 4553,
        "end_character": 4823
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We deliver a modular, comprehensive GCC service framework through three core offerings:",
        "start_character": 20423,
        "end_character": 20510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We help our clients expand globally by providing professional advisory and operations management services to establish and manage GCCs in strategically selected, cost-effective geographic locations that align with their operational requirements.",
        "start_character": 2562,
        "end_character": 2807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Approximately 60% of new GCC establishments are initiated by companies with annual revenues under $10 billion, and over 60% are developed by first-time adopters of the GCC model.¹ Within the India market where we maintain established operations, 583 GCCs specifically serve mid-market companies with annual revenues below $500 million, representing a core component of our addressable market within a broader ecosystem of 2,117 GCCs generating $98.4 billion in revenue and employing 2.36 million professionals.2",
        "start_character": 9720,
        "end_character": 10231
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These solutions and related concepts are currently protected as confidential information and trade secrets, and we may pursue additional intellectual property protections, where appropriate, upon completion of development.",
        "start_character": 40116,
        "end_character": 40338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We provide lifecycle strategy, design, and optional implementation support for organizations evaluating or advancing their GCC initiatives:",
        "start_character": 22413,
        "end_character": 22552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe market expansion is supported by several factors that align with our service capabilities and strategic positioning.",
        "start_character": 10659,
        "end_character": 10786
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We differentiate ourselves by focusing on private equity portfolio companies and mid-market enterprises, taking a comprehensive approach across the GCC lifecycle from strategy through operations, and integrating advanced technologies, including AI and digital transformation capabilities.",
        "start_character": 31191,
        "end_character": 31479
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We plan to sustain our high-quality customer service and operational performance by delivering superior service and employing skilled professionals.",
        "start_character": 18378,
        "end_character": 18526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001829126-26-006123",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001829126-26-006123-635bda23e98aaf45",
        "accession_number": "0001829126-26-006123",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We use senior leadership recommendations, market availability trends for required skill sets, and appropriate nearshore or offshore locations to deliver outsourcing services.",
        "start_character": 12332,
